  "description": "All that you need to know about SQL Mania SQL Mania is an offline competitive SQL event designed to evaluate participants’ database knowledge, analytical thinking, and real-world query writing skills. Participants will work on a structured relational database and solve industry-inspired problem statements using SQL queries within a fixed time limit. The competition emphasizes accuracy, efficiency, optimization, and clean query structuring — reflecting real-world backend development and data engineering scenarios. This event is ideal for students interested in: Data Analytics Backend Development Database Management Systems (DBMS) Software Engineering Eligibility: Individual Participation Open exclusively to Engineering Students Join our official WhatsApp group to receive further details and critical future updates. Click Here To Join",
