    "details": "<p class=\"blue_un-border-before hdng mock-title\"><strong>All that you need to know about SQL Mania</strong></p>\n<div class=\"position-relative\">\n<div class=\"blue_un-border-before comp-detail un_editor_text_live expanded\">\n<p><strong>SQL Mania </strong>is an offline competitive SQL event designed to evaluate participants&rsquo; database knowledge, analytical thinking, and real-world query writing skills. Participants will work on a structured relational database and solve industry-inspired problem statements using SQL queries within a fixed time limit. The competition emphasizes accuracy, efficiency, optimization, and clean query structuring &mdash; reflecting real-world backend development and data engineering scenarios.</p>\n<p><strong>This event is ideal for students interested in:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Data Analytics</li>\n<li>Backend Development</li>\n<li>Database Management Systems (DBMS)</li>\n<li>Software Engineering</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Individual Participation</li>\n<li>Open exclusively to Engineering Students</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Join our official WhatsApp group to receive further details and critical future updates. <a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/DX3U6Bt3Wz96AtAeBDYrs0?s=sw&amp;p=a&amp;iam=2\">Click Here To Join</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>",
